codex
I found the launcher failure’s concrete cause: Lean asks the kernel for `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, but this sandbox exposes only `/proc/self/exe` for that process, so `readlink` returns `-1`. I’m using a temporary preload shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; this changes neither the pinned toolchain nor project configuration, and I’ll remove the diagnostic source from the proof workspace afterward.
apply patch
